sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Account Servicer
    participant O as Account Owner
    rect rgb(245,248,255)
    Note over S,O: Announcement
    S->>O: Announcement of Event
    end
    rect rgb(245,248,255)
    Note over S,O: Eligibility / Entitlement
    Note over S,O: Ex-Date / Record Date / Effective Date
    S->>O: Notification of Entitled Position
    end
    rect rgb(245,248,255)
    Note over S,O: Pre-advice/Final Entitlement
    S->>O: Securities / cash Movements Preliminary Advice
    end
    rect rgb(245,248,255)
    Note over S,O: Confirmation
    Note over S,O: Payment Date
    S->>O: Confirmation of Account Posting
    end
